<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/529c98cf-5023-4b64-ac5d-2fadf5e258ff-01/SelectionCriterion$_ContractNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingTerms1_UBLExtensions1_UBLExtension1_ExtensionContent1_EformsExtension1_SelectionCriteria14>
